      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Title: A Rather Blustery Day. \"A Rather Blustery Day\" is a whimsical song from the Walt Disney musical film featurette, \"Winnie the Pooh and the Blustery Day\". It was written by Robert & Richard Sherman and sung by Jim Cummings as \"Pooh\".",
